host_about:
My family is very important to me. I enjoy the gym with friends, followed by coffee time. I attend our local Baptist church in Jacksonville.

I fundraise for Dominican Outreach by selling the following items;
Fiddleheads in the spring of the year and then Pickles, Jams and Jellies (all made with garden fresh veggies and fruits) at local farmers markets and craft sales all summer and fall. I also bake and sell cheesecakes for all occasions. You could say I spend a lot of time in the kitchen.

